          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೋರಾಟ — hōrāṭa — \"a struggle; a fight\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನೀರಿಗಾಗಿ ಹಳ್ಳಿಯವರ ಹೋರಾಟ ಹತ್ತು ವರ್ಷ ನಡೆಯಿತು. nīrigāgi haḷḷiyavara hōrāṭa hattu varṣa naḍeyitu. The villagers' struggle for water went on for ten years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From ಹೋರಾಡು, to fight."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೋರಾಟ (hōrāṭa) is a native Dravidian compound, the noun beside ಹೋರಾಡು: pōr, \"to fight, to strive\" (DEDR 4540), whose p- became h-, and āṭa, \"moving, playing\", from āḍu (DEDR 347)."
            }
          ]
        },
